---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Soul"
  description="About Eddie, the person behind nope digital."
  enableClientRouter={true}
>
  <section class="about-shell layout-shell page-shell">
    <div class="about-grid layout-grid">
      <article class="about">

        <h1 class="about-title">Soul.</h1>

        <p class="p--intro">
          Hi, I'm Eddie. I design and build websites, apps, and other things
          for screens. nope digital is the name I work under, but it's just me,
          working from just outside Stockholm.
        </p>

        <p class="p--punch">
          I want to make things<br>with some life in them.
        </p>

        <p class="p--body p--tilt-left">
          Most projects start with a mix of ideas, references, problems, and
          things that aren't quite clear yet. That's normal. I help turn that
          mix into something you can look at, talk through with me, and improve.
        </p>

        <p class="p--body p--right">
          You don't need to arrive with a finished brief or all the answers.
        </p>

        <p class="p--display">
          start with<br>what you<br>know.
        </p>

        <p class="p--body p--tilt-right">
          I ask questions, show the work early, and explain why I've made a
          choice. You can tell me when something doesn't feel right. That back
          and forth is part of the work, and it usually makes the result better.
        </p>

        <p class="p--body p--tilt-left">
          You work directly with me from start to finish. I do the design and
          frontend development myself, so there isn't a handoff between the
          person you talk to and the person making the thing.
        </p>

        <p class="p--outro">
          What I want at the end is quite simple: something that works well,
          has some character, and <strong>feels like it belongs to you</strong>.
        </p>

        <p class="p--body">
          If you're curious about how I ended up doing this, I've written a bit
          more about myself on the{" "}
          <a href="https://blog.nope.digital/about">blog</a>.
        </p>

      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
  }

  .about {
    grid-column: 3 / 11;
    /* Top spacing comes from .page-shell (--space-section), matching the
       work page; keep the generous bottom padding only. */
    padding-block: 0 clamp(6rem, 14vw, 12rem);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    overflow-x: hidden;
    transition: background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .about p {
    font-family: var(--font-family-prose);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Big display title, matching the work page's intro display. */
  .about-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-base);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 8rem);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-black);
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    color: var(--brand-purple);
  }

  :global([data-theme="experimental"]) .about-title {
    color: var(--neutral-50);
  }

  .about .p--intro {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .about .p--punch {
    font-family: var(--font-family-base);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .about .p--body {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .about .p--body a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: var(--space-1);
  }

  .about .p--right {
    margin-inline-start: auto;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .about .p--display {
    font-family: var(--font-family-base);
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 12vw, 10rem);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-black);
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .about .p--center {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .about .p--outro {
    font-family: var(--font-family-base);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .about .p--tilt-left {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 44ch;
    transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .about .p--tilt-right {
    transform: rotate(1deg);
  }

  /* Experimental theme */
  :global([data-theme="experimental"]) .about {
    color: var(--brand-green);
  }

  :global([data-theme="experimental"]) .about p {
    color: var(--brand-green);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
</style>
